  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Called from the router for support/dispute intents. Retrieves policy context from Pinecone (>=0.75 similarity + metadata filter), drafts a strictly-grounded reply, runs a dedicated second-pass hallucination check, and queues the draft with a plain-language explanation for staff approval. No reply is ever sent without an explicit human approval \u2014 below-threshold retrieval and hallucination flags both route to a human before a draft is even shown for approval."
  },
